uthor_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.5.dev4\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.dev4 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 7800 XT (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.21001.9024) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-12400 (12 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nI am using stricter code quality checks and have enabled the `debug/gdscript/warnings/unsafe_property_access` warning flag.\n\nThe problem is that the **Viewport** class does not have such a public property and it refers to an internal subclass or another class.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Enable the `debug/gdscript/warnings/unsafe_property_access` warning flag.\n2. Create a scene and add a script to it with the following content:\n\n```\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n    var screen_point: Vector2i = get_viewport().size / 2\n    print(screen_point)\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[viewport_property_size_2025-05-29_13-57-53.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20503282/viewport_property_size_2025-05-29_13-57-53.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"comminux","id":14937307,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTM3MzA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14937307?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/comminux","html_url":"https://github.com/comminux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comminux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comminux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comminux/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comminux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comminux/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github